Vendored front-end assets
=========================

No build step, no Node, no CDN. Everything here is served from the embedded
`staticFS` via `/static/`.

htmx.min.js
-----------
- Version: 1.9.12 (minified distribution build, unmodified bytes after the
  banner comment).
- Source:  https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@1.9.12/dist/htmx.min.js
- License: BSD 2-Clause — https://github.com/bigskysoftware/htmx/blob/v1.9.12/LICENSE
- Used for progressive enhancement only: every page and form still works with
  JavaScript disabled (plain GET links and POST -> redirect forms).

app.js
------
Hand-written vanilla helpers (no library):
- Countdown ticker for `[data-countdown]` elements (unix seconds -> "in 3m 4s").
- Mobile sidebar toggle wiring for the CSS checkbox hack.
